{"text": "Upchurch Residential Management, LLC - agent for Sweetwater Crossing Apartments\n1500 West Andrew Johnson Hwy, Office, Morristown, TN 37814  -  423-555-0111\n\n14-DAY NOTICE TO PAY RENT OR VACATE / AVISO DE 14 DÍAS PARA PAGAR LA RENTA O DESOCUPAR\n(Tenn. Code Ann. § 66-28-505)\n\nDate / Fecha: November 6, 2025 (6 de noviembre de 2025)\nTo / Para: REYNA ISABEL CIFUENTES DE LEÓN and all other occupants\nUnit / Unidad: 1500 W. Andrew Johnson Hwy, Apt. C-12      Lease no. SWC-C12-2023      Resident ID t0044187\n\nYou owe / Usted debe:  $1,946.00  (see ledger below / vea el estado de cuenta abajo)\nYou must pay this amount in full by November 20, 2025, or move out. If you do neither, we will file in General Sessions Court.\nUsted debe pagar esta cantidad completa a más tardar el 20 de noviembre de 2025, o desocupar la unidad. De lo contrario presentaremos una demanda de desalojo.\nPayment by money order or cashier's check only / Solo giro postal o cheque de caja. No se acepta efectivo.\n\nDarnell Upchurch, Property Manager          Delivered by: posting on door and first-class mail\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRESIDENT LEDGER - Cifuentes de León, Reyna - C-12              Contract rent $1,090  Tenant portion $412  HAP $678\nDate        Description                                   Charge      Payment     Balance\n08/01/25    Tenant rent Aug                               412.00                   412.00\n08/04/25    Money order #77204418                                     412.00        0.00\n09/01/25    Tenant rent Sep                               412.00                   412.00\n09/06/25    Late fee                                       50.00                   462.00\n09/19/25    Partial payment, cash app receipt R-118204                 200.00      262.00\n10/01/25    Rent Oct - FULL contract rent (HAP abated)  1,090.00                 1,352.00\n10/06/25    Late fee                                       50.00                 1,402.00\n11/01/25    Tenant rent Nov (HAP reinstated 10/28)         412.00                 1,814.00\n11/06/25    Late fee + notice fee                         132.00                 1,946.00\n\nMANAGER'S FILE NOTES (do not mail with the notice)\n- Household: Ms. Cifuentes and two children, Ximena, age 9, and Josué, age 6. Josué uses a wheelchair; ground-floor unit was a reasonable accommodation in 2023. Legal says be careful.\n- Housing Choice Voucher (Section 8) through the Nolichucky Housing Authority, caseworker ext. 214, voucher no. NHA-V-0044187. October HAP was abated because the unit failed inspection (OUR water heater), so the $678 for October is arguably not hers to pay. Check before filing: if we take that out she owes $1,268.\n- She lost hours at the poultry plant in September. Speaks Spanish; her English is limited. Her sister translates: 423.555.0158. Tenant's own cell (423) 555-0193.\n- Parking: one space, silver Honda Odyssey, tag 4T8 K71. A second car with Georgia plates has been in visitor parking for three weeks; lease violation letter NOT sent yet.\n- She asked D.U. on 11/3 whether a notice goes \"on her record with immigration.\" Told her we do not report to anyone. Did not ask her status and will not.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "447 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Reyna Isabel Cifuentes de León", "Ms. Cifuentes", "Ximena", "Josué", "D.U."], "companies": ["Upchurch Residential Management, LLC", "Sweetwater Crossing Apartments", "Darnell Upchurch", "Nolichucky Housing Authority", "poultry plant", "Georgia"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Morristown", "Sweetwater Crossing Apartments", "Nolichucky Housing Authority"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["immigration"], "names": ["Reyna", "Delarnell", "Ximena", "Josué", "D.U."]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.09999999403953552, "modelMs": 0, "topi